  "title": "Dairy-Free Milkshakes Arrive at All 220 Smashburger Locations - Non-Dairy Ice Cream - Eclipse Foods",
  "summary": "OAKLAND, Calif., June 21, 2022 /PRNewswire/ -- Eclipse Foods, the leader in plant-based dairy products that are indistinguishable from conventional dairy, announced today its partnership with Smashburger®, a leading fast-casual better burger restaurant, to create the industry's first nationally available plant-based milkshakes. The milkshakes are now available for purchase in…",
